594
00:26:13,133 --> 00:26:16,633
Um, we were just so grateful
with that journey.

595
00:26:16,833 --> 00:26:20,233
Us hosts at<i> Eat Bulaga</i> and
of course, Maine Mendoza too.

596
00:26:20,433 --> 00:26:23,267
And uh, we...

597
00:26:24,100 --> 00:26:26,800
How do I put it? We didn't
