655
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:39,400
[ALDEN] Woah! Dang!

656
00:28:39,400 --> 00:28:41,700
For real. We shed real tears.

657
00:28:41,700 --> 00:28:43,433
-I'll tell you their name later.
