- [LAUGHING]

659
00:28:45,833 --> 00:28:48,133
Since there's no<i> Eat Bulaga
</i>anymore, maybe we can hire them.

660
00:28:48,133 --> 00:28:50,233
[LAUGHTER]

661
00:28:50,233 --> 00:28:52,600
"Hey, maybe you can cook up
something for us."

662
00:28:52,600 --> 00:28:53,833
[SILLY SFX]

663
00:28:53,833 --> 00:28:55,300
[ALDEN] It was like...

664
00:28:55,600 --> 00:28:58,700
Yeah so, Maine started
at the barangay

665
00:28:58,700 --> 00:29:01,367
and then, for a time,
she still hasn't...

666
00:29:01,733 --> 00:29:04,800
I think she appeared once
or twice

667
00:29:04,800 --> 00:29:06,267
at the barangay already.

668
00:29:06,900 --> 00:29:08,600
I was at the studio
at that time.

669
00:29:08,600 --> 00:29:12,167
I hosted segments at Eat Bulaga

670
00:29:12,167 --> 00:29:14,433
