sitting at the panel.

673
00:29:18,667 --> 00:29:20,733
That's the main body
of the show.

674
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:22,900
I was having my lunch
then all of a sudden,

675
00:29:22,900 --> 00:29:25,133
the floor director called me
and said,

676
00:29:25,133 --> 00:29:28,100
"'Den, just sit there
at the front

677
00:29:28,100 --> 00:29:31,767
- [VICE] Mm-hmm.
- and watch the...

678
00:29:31,800 --> 00:29:34,267
- The segment.
- Juan for All, All for Juan."

679
00:29:34,267 --> 00:29:35,467
I was like, "Sure thing!"

680
00:29:35,467 --> 00:29:37,733
So I finished my meal quickly
and sat there and then...

681
00:29:38,067 --> 00:29:39,067
um...

682
