- [LAUGHTER]
- [LAUGH TRACK PLAYS]

2601
01:48:19,500 --> 01:48:21,167
<i> Good Evening Vulldog.</i>

2602
01:48:21,933 --> 01:48:23,533
<i> Good Evening Vulldog.</i>

2603
01:48:24,500 --> 01:48:25,967
