2621
01:49:05,000 --> 01:49:07,067
- We don't want to leave you.
- You're old.

2622
01:49:07,067 --> 01:49:08,533
- I just want you to be happy...
- Wow.

2623
01:49:08,533 --> 01:49:09,933
