will finally air.

3161
02:09:38,900 --> 02:09:40,233
It's called Code Gray.

3162
02:09:40,233 --> 02:09:43,267
And I'm very excited
about this project

3163
02:09:43,267 --> 02:09:44,900
because it's the first time
that I'm going to be

3164
02:09:44,900 --> 02:09:47,833
portraying a surgeon
who saves lives.

3165
02:09:47,833 --> 02:09:50,733
So we're going to be
tackling the drama

3166
02:09:50,733 --> 02:09:53,333
and the struggles
of the healthcare situation

3167
02:09:53,333 --> 02:09:54,367
here in the Philippines.

3168
02:09:54,367 --> 02:09:57,500
What are the struggles
of doctors and surgeons?

3169
02:09:57,500 --> 02:09:59,200
- And the patients.
- Yes, the patients' struggles.

3170
02:09:59,200 --> 02:10:02,500
Doctors seem to be
perfect, they know everything,

3171
02:10:02,500 --> 02:10:04,267
but there is a flaw
in the system.

3172
02:10:04,267 --> 02:10:06,867
So stay tuned for
<i> Code Gray</i> next year on GMA.

3173
02:10:06,867 --> 02:10:10,033
